{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Barbara": 22,
    "Bernhard": 24,
    "Georg": 9,
    "Paimon": 26,
    "Player": 15
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7051801",
      "subQuestName": "Take a stroll around The Weinlesefest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705180101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705180101": {
            "id": "705180101",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "Wait! Honorary Knight! And Paimon, the best guide in Teyvat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180102"
            ]
          },
          "705180102": {
            "id": "705180102",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "I humbly beg for your assistance!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180103"
            ]
          },
          "705180103": {
            "id": "705180103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! Did Paimon hear that right? Is Paimon finally starting to make a name for herself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180140"
            ]
          },
          "705180140": {
            "id": "705180140",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, wait... haven't we met...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180104"
            ]
          },
          "705180104": {
            "id": "705180104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes, in the main hall of the Knights of Favonius Headquarters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180105"
            ]
          },
          "705180105": {
            "id": "705180105",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "That's right. I am Bernhard, a member of the Logistics Company under Captain Hertha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180106"
            ]
          },
          "705180106": {
            "id": "705180106",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "Normally, I would hope to become better acquainted before asking for a favor like this... but time's running out, so I really have no choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180107"
            ]
          },
          "705180107": {
            "id": "705180107",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "Please help me rescue the charity event!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180108"
            ]
          },
          "705180108": {
            "id": "705180108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Rescue\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180109"
            ]
          },
          "705180109": {
            "id": "705180109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The charity event? Oh right, Master Jean mentioned that. So what's happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180110"
            ]
          },
          "705180110": {
            "id": "705180110",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "Well, the Knights of Favonius wants to run a stall during the festival...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180111"
            ]
          },
          "705180111": {
            "id": "705180111",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "The idea is for all profits from the sales to go to charity. Specifically, the funds will provide support to disadvantaged children and elderly citizens.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180112"
            ]
          },
          "705180112": {
            "id": "705180112",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "We drew lots to decide whose job it would be, and as it happened... I was the lucky winner. I really didn't want to screw this up, so I asked all around for advice, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180113"
            ]
          },
          "705180113": {
            "id": "705180113",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "My experience is in inventory and shipping. Now I'm supposed to run a whole shop, but it took me forever just to think of what to sell... I'm already completely out of my depth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180114"
            ]
          },
          "705180114": {
            "id": "705180114",
            "speakerId": 30234,
            "speakerName": "Bernhard",
            "text": "And that is why I humbly beseech you to render your assistance...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180117"
            ]
          },
          "705180117": {
            "id": "705180117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Also, no need to be so formal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180118"
            ]
          },
          "705180118": {
            "id": "705180118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, you said this is to help out the kids and old folks of Mondstadt, right? Sounds like a great cause!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180119"
            ]
          },
          "705180119": {
            "id": "705180119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME} is an Honorary Knight, and Paimon's a longtime friend of Favonius. We'll be more than happy to do our part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051804",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Bernhard",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051802",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Angel's Share's stall",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705180201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705180201": {
            "id": "705180201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hi there, Georg. We're Shevirme's agents. He's asked us to order 50 crates of Fruits of the Festival for him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180202"
            ]
          },
          "705180202": {
            "id": "705180202",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "Oh? Did you say Shevirme? He's a regular customer of mine. Always orders around the same amount each time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180203"
            ]
          },
          "705180203": {
            "id": "705180203",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "But I digress — what price are you offering this year?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051805",
      "subQuestName": "Negotiate with Georg",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182601": {
            "id": "705182601",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "As usual, I will arrange for someone to deliver the goods directly to Shevirme's place of business.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705182602"
            ]
          },
          "705182602": {
            "id": "705182602",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "You won't have to worry about a thing. Just make sure you keep hold of this receipt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705182603"
            ]
          },
          "705182603": {
            "id": "705182603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, let's keep bringing the funds in. We gotta work quickly if we wanna gather all these Fairbrew Jellies in time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705182604"
            ]
          },
          "705182604": {
            "id": "705182604",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Bernhard says we can approach this however we want, just as long as we raise all the funds we need...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705182605"
            ]
          },
          "705182605": {
            "id": "705182605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We get a commission for every order we help place for an international customer. So maybe it's not worth trying to sell loads of ingredients to the wine merchants...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705182606"
            ]
          },
          "705182606": {
            "id": "705182606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still... just to make sure we've covered everything, let's take a look at the other wine merchants."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051803",
      "subQuestName": "Check out the situation in other shops in advance",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705180301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705180301": {
            "id": "705180301",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, Paimon! You're here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180302"
            ]
          },
          "705180302": {
            "id": "705180302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! It's Barbara!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180305"
            ]
          },
          "705180305": {
            "id": "705180305",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Thanks! And happy Weinlesefest to you, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180306"
            ]
          },
          "705180306": {
            "id": "705180306",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "This festival is one of the most popular ones in Mondstadt. I'm so happy I ran into you guys here. I hope you have a great time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180307"
            ]
          },
          "705180307": {
            "id": "705180307",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Oh, also, I heard from Georg that you're collecting Fairbrew Jellies?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180308"
            ]
          },
          "705180308": {
            "id": "705180308",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "I'm just curious, are you helping out with the Knights of Favonius charity event?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180309"
            ]
          },
          "705180309": {
            "id": "705180309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We sure are! Everybody's gotta do their part, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180310"
            ]
          },
          "705180310": {
            "id": "705180310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The stall isn't up and running yet. We're busy raising funds so they can open for business!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180311"
            ]
          },
          "705180311": {
            "id": "705180311",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's sure to be a bunch of other problems to deal with once it's open, but whatever comes up, we'll deal with it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180312"
            ]
          },
          "705180312": {
            "id": "705180312",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Wonderful! Heehee... they're lucky to have you. Now that you've joined the team, I just know it'll be a huge success!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180313"
            ]
          },
          "705180313": {
            "id": "705180313",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thanks for your encouragement!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180314"
            ]
          },
          "705180314": {
            "id": "705180314",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "I helped out at a small charity sale for the Knights once, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180315"
            ]
          },
          "705180315": {
            "id": "705180315",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Although... my only contribution was standing out front and singing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180316"
            ]
          },
          "705180316": {
            "id": "705180316",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Oh! And I also met the bard, Venti there! He even persuaded me to perform an impromptu song with him...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180317"
            ]
          },
          "705180317": {
            "id": "705180317",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "The music he plays is quite refined and elegant. At first, I didn't want to sing too loudly, in case I ruined the style he was going for...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180318"
            ]
          },
          "705180318": {
            "id": "705180318",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "But he sang a harmony to guide me in, and before long, we were sounding great.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180319"
            ]
          },
          "705180319": {
            "id": "705180319",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "In the end, the audience loved it, and we sold a lot at the event.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180320"
            ]
          },
          "705180320": {
            "id": "705180320",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So Barbara's worked with the Tone-Deaf Bard before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180321"
            ]
          },
          "705180321": {
            "id": "705180321",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I wish I could have been there to hear it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180322"
            ]
          },
          "705180322": {
            "id": "705180322",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "Yeah... too bad we couldn't fit it into the schedule this year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705180323"
            ]
          },
          "705180323": {
            "id": "705180323",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Barbara",
            "text": "The Church of Favonius wants to hold a sung poetry event somewhere with a nice view during the festival, which means I have to go to rehearsal..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051821",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182101": {
            "id": "705182101",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "I'm sorry — Did you even speak to Shevirme before deciding on a price? You must be joking, that's much too low."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051822",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182201": {
            "id": "705182201",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "Look, I know we've had a great harvest this year and our production costs have gone down a fair amount, but even then... I'm afraid this price is just not doable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051823",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182301": {
            "id": "705182301",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "Sounds good to me, that's around the same price we've agreed in previous years, too. We have a deal!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051824",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182401": {
            "id": "705182401",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "Hmm... A little lower than I was hoping for. But he's a reliable customer. I think I can make it work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051825",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705182501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705182501": {
            "id": "705182501",
            "speakerId": 30235,
            "speakerName": "Georg",
            "text": "I'm sorry, but I just can't consider going that low. If you're serious about placing an order, please, just take my price."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051899",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705189901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705189901": {
            "id": "705189901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, there are a ton of sellers at the Weinlesefest. Should be some pretty cool stuff to check out, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705189902"
            ]
          },
          "705189902": {
            "id": "705189902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go and browse while we still have the chance!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705189903"
            ]
          },
          "705189903": {
            "id": "705189903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That must be Georg. Let's go talk business!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}